# The parameters fetched on connecting, MAVFTP first (PLAN.md §13.6 row 81).
#
# The claim: once a vehicle is heard and no parameters are held, the application fetches them
# without being asked, as MAVLinkInterface.Open does (MAVLinkInterface.cs:930-939) - reading
# @PARAM/param.pck?withdefaults=1 over MAVFTP in 110-byte bursts and unpacking it
# (getParamListMavftp, :1813-1936; parampck.cs), the PARAM_REQUEST_LIST stream only if that will
# not do. The fact params.fetch says which way they came. The screen's download button runs the
# same fetch (getParamList, :1781-1799).
#
# SITL's copter serves the file, so its 1,400-odd parameters arrive in a few seconds over MAVFTP
# and the stream is never asked for. Nothing is written.
#
# Needs SITL copter on tcp:127.0.0.1:5760 started from tools/sitl/params/copter.parm. Run as
#
#   tools/gui-test.sh tests/gui/params-autofetch.gui -- tcp:127.0.0.1:5760

screen params
window 1600x1200
budget 4
# A config.xml of its own, so the "Show me again?" boxes this script clicks are not already
# suppressed by the settings of the machine running it.
env MP_CONFIG_XML $WORK/config.xml
# RawParamWarning, on the Full Parameter List's Activate (ConfigRawParams.cs:92): "Show me
# again?" unticked, so no later visit asks, and OK.
# The vehicle first: a click before its first heartbeat is a click the screen may forget
# (vehicle.connected only says the link is open).
expect vehicle.count > 0
click raw-param-warning-again
click raw-param-warning-ok

expect vehicle.connected true
expect params.held > 1000
expect params.expected > 1000
expect params.fetch ~ over MAVFTP
expect params.value.INS_GYRO_FILTER 20

# The file carried the defaults, so the Default column and the None Default box show
# (ConfigRawParams.cs:598-603, 653-654); the box leaves the parameters off their defaults.
expect params.defaults > 1000
expect params.none_default false
click param-none-default
expect params.none_default true
click param-none-default
expect params.none_default false

# The button fetches again, the same way.
click param-download
expect params.held > 1000
expect params.fetch ~ over MAVFTP
